http://www.woerterbuchnetz.de/woerterbuecher/dwb/wbgui?lemid=GM04087
(no single article for "-tum" resp. "-thum", but as a suffix it was
highly productive, although nowadays it sounds really oldfashioned and
as a synonym for "-heit" it is completely outdated and unused IMO)

